OL,3,GNEWSATrains to be reintroduced after
OL,4,Aspeed restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of Southern Railway services
OL,7,Facross Sussex are due to be
OL,8,Freintroduced on Monday following
OL,9,Fmultiple speed restrictions across the
OL,10,Fnetwork.
OL,12,FOff-peak services between
OL,13,FEastbourne/Ore and London Victoria, via
OL,14,FLewes and Haywards Heath, will be
OL,15,Freinstated, having not run over after
OL,16,F09:00 BST for the last four weeks due
OL,17,Fto the hot and dry weather affecting
OL,18,Ftrack conditions.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
