OL,3,GNEWSATrains to be reintroduced after
OL,4,Aspeed restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour services will be reintroduced
OL,7,Fbetween Uckfield and London Bridge in
OL,8,Fthe morning and early evening, with all
OL,9,Fother services to follow the existing
OL,10,Ftemporary timetable until 2 November.
OL,12,FAnother four services between
OL,13,FLittlehampton, Bognor Regis and London
OL,14,Fwill also be brought back, two each in
OL,15,Fthe morning and evening.
